      "id": 1,
      "text": "Holt was named for Jeremiah Abel Holt, 1811‑1886, who donated the land in 1837 and was one of the area’s first settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holt%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1917 Sanborn Fire Insurance Map of Holt shows downtown streets, businesses, and the railroad depot that once anchored the town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-holt-missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 1882 book 'The History of Holt and Atchison Counties' offers biographical sketches, statistics, and portraits of early settlers.",
